          <span
            class="mode-badge"
          >
            Fixture preview
          </span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="brief-card__headline"
        >
          Demand is up; AC repair conversion needs attention.
        </p>
        <div
          class="brief-card__signal"
        >
          <span
            class="signal-number"
          >
            01
          </span>
          <div>
