          </h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          These values preview the frozen synthetic specification. They are not yet connected to the database or presented as implemented analytics.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="metric-grid"
      >
        <article
          class="metric-card"
        >
          <div
            class="metric-card__header"
          >
            <span>
              Website sessions
            </span>
            <span
              class="preview-chip"
            >
              Preview
            </span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="metric-card__value-row"
          >
            <strong>
              10,440
            </strong>
            <span>
              +10.1%
            </span>
          </div>
          <p>
